            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "In my case, it was a broken test harness that caused the issue. I do not fully understand how the output of `debug.traceback` is used, but it is probably a plus that error reporting stays predictable (always reflecting the behaviour of the stock `debug.traceback`). Caching is already done for other funcs; so not entirely a new nvim behaviour.   ",
